// Title: Potential Binary Proxy Execution Via VSDiagnostics.EXE
// ID: ac1c92b4-ac81-405a-9978-4604d78cc47e
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-08-03
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218
// Description: Detects execution of "VSDiagnostics.exe" with the "start" command in order to launch and proxy arbitrary binaries.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_ /launch:*" or process.command_line like "*_ -launch:*")) and (process.command_line like "*_start*") and ((process.executable endswith "\\VSDiagnostics.exe") or (process.pe.original_file_name == "VSDiagnostics.exe")))
